---
title: Chat and Delegation Flow
---
flowchart TB
    User([User message]) --> API[Chat API]
    API --> Interest[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>typed semantic memory agent]
    Interest --> Proposal[Auto-saved memory records<br/>written immediately, no approval step]
    API --> FollowUp[Follow-up resolver<br/>one reading of this · it · again<br/>picture · task · scout · draft · subject]
    FollowUp --> Selector{MainActionSelector<br/>one native tool call, all options together}
    Search_Tool[Internet MCP server<br/>search_web · get_weather<br/>search_credits for operators only] -.-> Selector
    Toolbox[User-registered<br/>MCP tools, shortlisted] -.-> Selector

    Selector -->|delegate_to_presentation_agent| Presentation[Queue durable<br/>PresentationAgent job]
    Presentation --> Progress[Return job ID<br/>and background progress]

    Selector -->|create_diagram| Diagram[DiagramAgent]
    Diagram --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference -->|diagram role| DiagramModel[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>diagram call via vLLM]
    DiagramModel --> Artifact[Validate and persist<br/>Mermaid artifact]

    Selector -->|generate_image or edit_image| ImageAction[Generate or source-conditioned<br/>edit via ComfyUI FLUX]
    Selector -->|show_image| Referent
    Selector -->|discuss_image: nothing runs| Memory
    ImageAction -->|explicit image| ImageArtifact[Persist ready/failed<br/>image artifact]
    ImageAction -->|no explicit image| Referent[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>owned-image referent resolution]
    Referent -->|one match| ImageArtifact
    Referent -->|show: newest match re-streamed<br/>as artifact_started + artifact_ready| Stream
    Referent -->|ambiguous edit or absent| Stream

    Selector -->|neither| Memory[MemoryCoordinatorAgent<br/>personal memory retrieval]
    Memory --> ArtifactGate{DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>artifact modality gate}
    ArtifactGate -->|image required| Visual[Owner-scoped pixel-vector lookup<br/>then description-vector fallback]
    ArtifactGate -->|no artifact needed| Context[Curated context]
    Visual --> VisualPolicy[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>visual-memory selection]
    VisualPolicy --> Context
    Selector -->|search_web, search_history, get_weather,<br/>search_credits, a toolbox tool, schedule_task,<br/>manage_tasks, manage_check_ins, scout_schedule,<br/>save_skill, manage_skills, manage_runs| Steps
    Steps[Turn step loop · run_steps<br/>TURN_MAX_STEPS, TURN_STEP_BUDGET_SECONDS read<br/>before every decision and action,<br/>TURN_MAX_CREATES new things] --> Apply[Carry out one step · outcome recorded<br/>found, done, scheduled · failed, not_found,<br/>refused, blocked · unknown when cut at the deadline]
    Apply -->|what was done and how it went;<br/>offered only tools whose effect contract<br/>allows a later step: a read or a write to<br/>this system's records, not expensive,<br/>no approval| Selector
    Apply -->|no next tool · needs input · router failed<br/>· a repeat by key · the creation allowance<br/>· the step ceiling · the clock| Memory
    Apply -->|the clock or the ceiling, work left,<br/>AGENT_RUNS_ENABLED| HandOff[(agent_runs · chat_continuation<br/>the words · the step lines · the channel<br/>finished by the run worker; reply says so)]
    Contracts[Effect contracts on every tool row<br/>effect · cost · key · creates · approval · retry] -.-> Steps
    Contracts -.-> MCP

    Apply -->|search_web query,<br/>model-authored| Personalize{DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>does this depend on who is asking?<br/>which interests to search with}
    Persona[Interests as a person<br/>seven dance rows are one fact<br/>cached on the interest set] -.-> Memory
    Personalize -->|terms held into the query in code,<br/>disposition kept for the ranking| Search[Privacy-screened internet search<br/>credit-accurate budget · a failed search<br/>becomes turn state the reply admits]
    Apply -->|search_history query| History[Transcript-store semantic search<br/>top 40 by vector, both voices, HNSW<br/>ONNX cross-encoder cuts to 12, fail-soft]
    Apply -->|toolbox tool| MCP[Guarded MCP invocation<br/>per-tool approval and replay policy<br/>whole-schema validation · nested screening]
    MCP --> Context
    Search --> Context
    History --> Context

    Context --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Main[DeepSeek-V4-Flash<br/>streaming call via DGX Spark]
    Main --> Persist[Persist completed turn<br/>and lifecycle updates]
    Persist --> Stream[SSE response]
    Proposal --> Stream

    Artifact --> Stream
    ImageArtifact --> Stream
    Progress --> Stream
    Stream --> UI[Visible answer, artifact,<br/>tool/search status, or job progress]

    Failure[Sanitized failure] -.-> Stream

